#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/video_waveform_monitor.rst:67
msgid ""
"Set intensity. Smaller values are useful to find out how many values of the "
"same luminance are distributed across input rows/columns. Default value is "
"0.04. Allowed range is [0, 1]."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví intenzitu. Menšie hodnoty sú užitočné na zistenie, koľko hodnôt "
"rovnakej luminancie je rozložených v riadkoch/stĺpcoch vstupu. Predvolená "
"hodnota je 0,04. Povolený rozsah je [0, 1]."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/video_waveform_monitor.rst:68
msgid "Mirror"
msgstr "Zrkadliť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/video_waveform_monitor.rst:69
msgid "Switch"
msgstr "Prepnúť"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/utility/video_waveform_monitor.rst:70
msgid ""
"Set mirroring mode. In mirrored mode, higher values will be represented on "
"the left side for row mode and at the top for column mode. Default is "
"**Off**."
msgstr ""
"Nastaví režim zrkadlenia. V zrkadlovom režime budú vyššie hodnoty zobrazené "
"na ľavej strane v režime riadkov a hore v režime stĺpcov. Predvolené je "
"**Vyp.**."

